### 3️⃣ Day 5-6: Dependency Resolution (450줄)

**목적**: 의존성 그래프 구축 및 순환 감지

**핵심 구조체**:
```rust
pub struct DependencyNode {
    pub node_id: u32,
    pub module_id: u32,
    pub module_name: String,
    pub version: String,
    pub dependencies: Vec<u32>,
    pub dependents: Vec<u32>,
}

pub struct DependencyGraph {
    nodes: HashMap<u32, DependencyNode>,
    module_to_node: HashMap<u32, u32>,
    next_node_id: u32,
}

pub struct CircularDependencyDetector;

pub struct TopologicalSorter;

pub struct DependencyResolver {
    graph: DependencyGraph,
    resolved_order: Vec<u32>,
    unresolved_modules: HashSet<u32>,
}
```

**특징**:
- DependencyNode로 그래프 노드 표현
- DependencyGraph로 전체 의존성 맵
- DFS 기반 순환 감지 (O(V+E))
- 위상 정렬로 로드 순서 결정
- DependencyResolver가 전체 해결 조율

**알고리즘**:
```
Circular Detection: DFS with recursion stack
- Time: O(V + E)
- Space: O(V)

Topological Sort: DFS-based Kahn variant
- Time: O(V + E)
- Space: O(V)
```

