## 핵심 알고리즘

### Circular Dependency Detection (DFS)
```
algorithm has_cycle(graph):
    visited = ∅, rec_stack = ∅
    for each node in graph.nodes:
        if node not in visited:
            if dfs(node, visited, rec_stack):
                return true
    return false

algorithm dfs(node, visited, rec_stack):
    visited.add(node)
    rec_stack.add(node)

    for each neighbor in node.dependencies:
        if neighbor not in visited:
            if dfs(neighbor, visited, rec_stack):
                return true
        elif neighbor in rec_stack:
            return true  // 순환 발견

    rec_stack.remove(node)
    return false
```

**복잡도**: O(V + E) / O(V)

### Topological Sort (DFS-based)
```
algorithm topological_sort(graph):
    visited = ∅, stack = ∅

    for each node in graph.nodes:
        if node not in visited:
            dfs_visit(node, visited, stack)

    return stack (역순)
```

**복잡도**: O(V + E) / O(V)

